# Tailwind-only styling

Style Astro components with Tailwind utility classes directly on elements.

Do not add `@layer components` or bespoke CSS class names for UI elements (e.g. `.btn-link`, `.banner`).

Allowed exceptions in global CSS:

- `@theme` design tokens (colors, fonts, animations)
- `body` base background (dot grid)
- `@keyframes` for animations that cannot be expressed as utilities

When adding new components, put all layout, color, typography, and state styles in `class=""` attributes.
